  "notes": "### macOS Universal 2.3.3\n\nRequires macOS 14.4 or later. The separate Apple Silicon, Windows, and Linux downloads are available from their previous releases.\n\n- Add checkmark, cross, PASS, and FAIL markup. PASS and FAIL stamps retain the placement date. VIEWER can display MARK annotations.\n- Add a dockable Standards Reference workspace with temporary annotations and local previews for PDFs, text, tables, and iWork documents.\n- Send drawings to Pages and Keynote or literal table values to Numbers. iWork previews and direct Keynote insertion may require macOS Automation permission.\n- Delete every image layer, clear the canvas on close, and remove backgrounds from a dedicated button.\n- Inherit the preceding slide’s background when exporting into PowerPoint.\n\nThe packaged app passed native Intel testing. Every Mach-O binary contains both x86_64 and arm64 slices. The arm64 slices of this exact build were checked structurally. The app is ad-hoc signed.\n\nThe attached source archive contains the application and build scripts. `THIRD_PARTY_SOURCES.txt` lists corresponding upstream archives, and `SHA256SUMS.txt` lists the release checksums.\n",
